# @atpost/* packages are hosted in AWS CodeArtifact. Inside this monorepo they
# resolve via the workspace (workspace:*), so no registry config is needed for
# local dev. To PUBLISH them, or to INSTALL them from outside the monorepo
# (e.g. the mobile app), authenticate first — this writes the scoped registry +
# token into your .npmrc automatically:
#
#   aws codeartifact login --tool npm \
#     --domain atpost --repository atpost-web \
#     --namespace @atpost --region ap-south-1
#
# (Endpoint comes from `terraform output codeartifact_npm_endpoint`.)
